@startuml packages
title Пакеты и правила зависимостей (AD-01, NFR-TST-002)

package "src" {
  package "rcad" {
    component [schemas] as SCHEMAS
    component [diagnostics] as DIAG

    package "core" {
      component [netlist] as NETLIST
      component [circuit] as CIRCUIT
      component [mna] as MNA
      component [solver] as SOLVER
      component [integ] as INTEG
      component [analyses] as ANALYSES
      component [devices\n(contract, primitives)] as COREDEV
    }

    component [devices\n(builtin models)] as DEV
    component [veriloga] as VA
    component [abi] as ABI
    component [services] as SVC
    component [ui] as UI
    component [cli] as CLI
  }
  component [main.py] as MAIN
}

folder "data/symbols/" as SYM
folder "tests/golden/" as GOLD
folder "<project>.rcad/" as PROJ
artifact "cache/<sha256>.dll" as DLL

MAIN --> UI
MAIN --> CLI
UI --> SVC
CLI --> SVC

SVC --> ANALYSES
SVC --> NETLIST
SVC --> SCHEMAS
SVC --> DEV
SVC --> VA
SVC --> ABI
SVC --> PROJ
SVC --> GOLD

ANALYSES --> SOLVER
ANALYSES --> INTEG
ANALYSES --> MNA
ANALYSES --> CIRCUIT
ANALYSES --> DIAG
MNA --> CIRCUIT
MNA --> COREDEV
SOLVER --> MNA
INTEG --> MNA
CIRCUIT --> NETLIST
NETLIST --> DIAG
VA --> ABI
DEV --> COREDEV
DEV --> SYM
ABI --> DLL

legend right
  **Разрешённые направления (вниз):**
  ui → services → core, abi, veriloga
  analyses → solver, integ, mna, circuit
  mna → circuit, core.devices
  circuit → netlist
  любой core/* → schemas, diagnostics

  **Запрещено (CI, NFR-TST-002):**
  core/devices/veriloga → PySide6, pyqtgraph, rcad.ui
  rcad.devices → rcad.analyses
  ui → core.mna, core.solver (только через services)

  **Компилятор (E2):**
  veriloga → cl.exe → cache DLL → abi → VaDevice
end legend

@enduml
